operties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">4.0<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">May 20, 1998<br/>Beta 4.0</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20050611020531&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Warrior_Helmet_7e280b.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a warrior helmet <span class=\"p-attributes\">(Arm:8)</span>.<br/>Imbuements: (Empty Slot, Empty Slot).<br/>Classification: 2 Tier: 0.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 68.00 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Heavy helmet compared to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Crusader%20Helmet\">Crusader Helmet</a> which is lighter and has the same armor rating. Also, the price is lower because of its weight and because it is quite easy to loot.\nIt can be obtained from <a href=\"#/quest/deeper-fibula-quest\">Deeper Fibula Quest</a>.<br/>\n4 warrior helmets can be traded by <a href=\"#/wiki/Haroun\">Haroun</a> (<a href=\"#/wiki/Ashta%27daramai\">Blue Djinn Fortress</a>) or <a href=\"#/wiki/Yaman\">Yaman</a> (<a href=\"#/wiki/Mal%27ouquah\">Green Djinn Fortress</a>) for 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20of%20Warrior%27s%20Sweat\">Flask of Warrior's Sweat</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-w